OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot attacked captain with
OL,4,Aaxe, UAE official says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-pilot of the Flydubai plane
OL,7,Ftravelling to Israel attacked the pilot
OL,8,Fwith a crash axe in an attempt to take
OL,9,Fcontrol of the aircraft, the United
OL,10,FArab Emirates prosecutor general has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv
OL,14,Fcarrying more than 170 people plunged
OL,15,Fmore than 17,000ft (5,200m) two and a
OL,16,Fhalf hours into its journey.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
