OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot attacked captain with
OL,4,Aaxe, UAE official says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCapt Smit Machchhar said he was lying
OL,7,Fon the cockpit floor injured when he
OL,8,Frealised the plane was sinking and he
OL,9,Fhad to act, explaining: "I told myself
OL,10,Fto go for one last push to open the
OL,11,Fdoor from inside."
OL,13,FPassengers aboard the aircraft were
OL,14,Fthen able to enter the cockpit and
OL,15,Foverpower the attacker, while on-duty
OL,16,Fcrew travelling on the flight entered
OL,17,Fthe cockpit and landed the plan safely.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
